NODE id=matrix/router/internal/proxy.Handler.WakeHandler kind=method
  digest=b3:6933c0cb68dd2409c29bfe1c1c5eb370b76b56b6836ef6ba9b284e0afe2d710a file=router/internal/proxy/wake.go range=45:140 lang=go exported=true byte_range=1507:4951
  sig=func (h *Handler) WakeHandler() http.HandlerFunc
  doc=WakeHandler returns the HTTP handler for POST /internal/wake. It resolves the\ntarget user's environment, wakes it, waits for the daemon to bind, and\nforwards a chat turn to the daemon's /chat endpoint. The caller is\nresponsible for authenticating the request (wake token).
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/router/internal/proxy.Handler
  ^defines=matrix/router/internal/proxy/wake.go

