  sig=func (h *Handler) deliverChat(ctx context.Context, env *provision.Env, req WakeRequest) (status int, body []byte, err error)
  doc=deliverChat POSTs the wake turn to the daemon's /chat endpoint over the\nprivate network, mirroring the public proxy's forwarding hygiene\n(X-Matrix-User, no inbound Authorization). Returns the daemon's status + body.
